      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Private ingress",
      "items": [
        "Cloudflare publishes DNS but never proxies application traffic",
        "One private VIP serves all three monitoring hostnames",
        "Tailnet policy remains the network access boundary"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Controller ownership",
      "items": [
        "Envoy Gateway owns the generated Service, Pod, and xDS configuration",
        "Tailscale advertises the unique monitoring Service through both shared proxies"
